<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Operation Black Buck 1, 1982</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;As the Royal Navy Task Force&amp;nbsp;arrives to enforce a 200nm exclusion zone around the islands, RAF Vulcans fly the longest-range bombing mission in history to fire the opening shots of the Falklands War.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;***&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Designers note:&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;For more information, some hints on planning the mission, and apparently,&amp;nbsp;a hotbed of&amp;nbsp;debate -&amp;nbsp;the wiki page on the Black Buck missions should have all you need.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
